  {"id": "vo.yoku", "lesson": "le.l05", "lesson_order": 24, "surface": "よく", "kana": "よく", "zh": ["常常", "經常", "好好地", "仔細地"], "pos": "adv", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adverb"], "examples": ["se.l05.055", "se.l05.056"], "trap_zh": "兩個意思都很常用，要看上下文：表頻率是「常常」，如 {ja:よく読みます|よくよみます}；表程度是「好好地、仔細地」，如 {ja:よく寝る|よくねる}（睡飽）、{ja:よく考える|よくかんがえる}（仔細想）。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.tokidoki", "lesson": "le.l05", "lesson_order": 25, "surface": "時々", "kana": "ときどき", "zh": ["有時候"], "pos": "adv", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adverb"], "examples": ["se.l05.059", "se.l05.060"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.amari", "lesson": "le.l05", "lesson_order": 26, "surface": "あまり", "kana": "あまり", "zh": ["不太（接否定）"], "pos": "adv", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adverb"], "examples": ["se.l05.063", "se.l05.064"], "trap_zh": "本課表示「不太」的 {ja:あまり} 搭配否定：{ja:あまり飲みません|あまりのみません}。不要把這個搭配當成所有用法的限制。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.zenzen", "lesson": "le.l05", "lesson_order": 27, "surface": "全然", "kana": "ぜんぜん", "zh": ["完全不（接否定）"], "pos": "adv", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["adverb"], "same_form_zh": true, "examples": ["se.l05.067", "se.l05.068"], "trap_zh": "初學請先固定搭配否定：{ja:全然飲みません|ぜんぜんのみません}。口語裡也聽得到 {ja:全然大丈夫|ぜんぜんだいじょうぶ}（完全沒問題）這種接肯定的說法。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.issho_ni", "lesson": "le.l06", "lesson_order": 20, "surface": "一緒に", "kana": "いっしょに", "zh": ["一起"], "pos": "adv", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["adverb"], "examples": ["se.l06.015", "se.l06.020", "se.l07.002", "se.l07.003"], "notes": ["no.rd.sokuon"]},
  {"id": "vo.totemo", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 21, "surface": "とても", "kana": "とても", "zh": ["非常", "很"], "pos": "adv", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adverb"], "examples": ["se.l09.041", "se.l09.042", "se.l19.044"], "trap_zh": "本課的 {ja:とても} 表示「非常」，先練習接形容詞的肯定說法。「不太……」常用 {ja:あまり} 搭配否定；{ja:とても} 也能和否定搭配，表示「怎麼也做不到」。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.chotto", "lesson": "le.l09", "lesson_order": 22, "surface": "ちょっと", "kana": "ちょっと", "zh": ["一點點", "稍微"], "pos": "adv", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["adverb"], "examples": ["se.l09.043", "se.l09.044", "se.l13.027", "se.l15.005"], "trap_zh": "句尾拖長、不把話說完時，是委婉的拒絕。", "notes": []},
